nk":null},{"localized_name":"top_p","name":"top_p","shape":7,"type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"top_p"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"top_k","name":"top_k","shape":7,"type":"INT","widget":{"name":"top_k"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"repetition_penalty","name":"repetition_penalty","shape":7,"type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"repetition_penalty"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"subtalker_temperature","name":"subtalker_temperature","shape":7,"type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"subtalker_temperature"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"subtalker_top_p","name":"subtalker_top_p","shape":7,"type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"subtalker_top_p"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"subtalker_top_k","name":"subtalker_top_k","shape":7,"type":"INT","widget":{"name":"subtalker_top_k"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"音频","name":"AUDIO","type":"AUDIO","links":[2]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Qwen3TTSVoiceDesign"},"widgets_values":["你好,[pause:0.6]欢迎收听本期节目。[pause:0.8]今天天气真好。","【说话人描述】22岁沉稳磁性男声:音色低沉浑厚,带轻微沙哑质感,胸腔共鸣明显,发音清晰圆润,咬字利落,语速平稳,无情绪起伏,中性自然。\n【核心要求】务必突出上述音色特征,音色是唯一重点","Chinese","Concatenate (Merge)",312113011716612,"randomize",2048,0.9,1,50,1.05,0.9,1,50]},{"id":3,"type":"PreviewAudio","pos":[910,0],"size":[260,130],"flags":{"pinned":true},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"音频","name":"audio","type":"AUDIO","link":2},{"localized_name":"音频UI","name":"audioUI","type":"AUDIO_UI","widget":{"name":"audioUI"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"audio","name":"audio","type":"AUDIO","slot_index":0,"links":[3]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"PreviewAudio","cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.21.1","enableTabs":false,"tabWidth":65,"tabXOffset":10,"hasSecondTab":false,"secondTabText":"Send Back","secondTabOffset":80,"secondTabWidth":65},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":4,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[50,620],"size":[1170,420],"flags":{"pinned":true},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"使用说明","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## Qwen3-TTS 文生人物说话(纯文本,无需参考音频)\n\n**流程**:Loader(VoiceDesign 模型)→ VoiceDesign 自然语言造声 → 预览\n\n**插件**:ComfyUI-Qwen3-TTS;模型 Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-VoiceDesign 已就位(models/TTS/Qwen/)\n\n**VoiceDesign 音色设计**(节点 2):用**自然语言描述声音特征**凭空造声,无需任何参考音频:\n- 示例:\"温柔御姐音,语速偏慢,带一丝笑意\"\"沉稳磁性的大叔音,低沉圆润\"\"活泼的少女音,清脆明亮\"\"略带紧张的17岁男生,音域偏高\"\n- 情绪可融入描述:愤怒/悲伤/兴奋/温柔...\n- 文本内支持 [pause:0.8] 停顿控制\n- 也支持中英混合文本\n\n**预设音色(备用)**:换 Loader 模型为 1.7B-CustomVoice 并改用 Qwen3TTSCustomVoice 节点,内置 9 音色:Vivian(明亮年轻女声)/Serena(温暖柔和)/Uncle_Fu(沉稳男声)/Dylan(北京青年)/Eric(成都男声)/Ryan(动态男声)/Aiden(阳光美式男声)/Ono_Anna(日语女声)/Sohee(韩语女声)\n\n**提示**:VoiceDesign 与 CustomVoice 是不同模型文件,切换功能需同步更换 Loader 中的模型。"],"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":5,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[1690,-10],"size":[600,1430],"flags":{"pinned":true},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"提示词模板","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 文生人物说话提示词模板(Qwen3-TTS 音色设计)\n\n核心:音色设计用\"自然语言描述声音\"凭空造声 —— 讲清音色特征、年龄性别气质、语速、情绪。文本只决定\"说什么\",声音由声音描述参数决定。\n\n公式(声音描述):性别与年龄 -> 音色特征 -> 语速与节奏 -> 情绪语气 -> 气质风格\n\n1. 性别年龄:男/女/中性 + 幼年/少年/青年/中年/老年\n2. 音色:磁性/清脆/沙哑/圆润/明亮/低沉/纤细\n3. 语速节奏:快/慢/适中/拖沓/利落\n4. 情绪语气:温柔/愤怒/兴奋/悲伤/冷酷/俏皮/威严(可叠加)\n5. 气质风格:御姐/大叔/萝莉/播音腔/邻家/帝王感\n\n文本控制:\n- 停顿:[pause:0.8] 插入指定秒数\n- 中英混合文本均支持\n\n示例:\n\"温柔御姐音,语速偏慢,带一丝笑意,像深夜电台主持人\"\n\"活泼的少女音,清脆明亮,语速轻快,充满元气\"\n\"略带紧张的十七岁男生,音域偏高,紧张时元音会收紧\"\n\"沉稳磁性的大叔音,低沉圆润,语速沉稳,威严感\"\n\n---\n\n## 基础参考音频模板(生成后接入 06 参考克隆用)\n\n**重要:参考音频必须单一中性情绪、平稳语速(3-15 秒)。**\n带多种情绪的音频不适合做克隆参考 —— 情绪会混入声纹,导致克隆相似度下降、音色不稳定、后续情绪控制被污染。\n\n**参考文本(短句一句一顿,约 10 秒,直接填入):**\n\"你好,[pause:0.6]欢迎收听本期节目。[pause:0.8]今天天气真好,[pause:0.5]再见!\"\n\n**声音描述(重点突出音色特征,可替换音色):**\n- 沉稳磁性男声:音色低沉浑厚,带轻微沙哑质感,胸腔共鸣明显,发音清晰圆润,咬字利落\n- 温柔女声:音色温暖柔和,气声明显,轻声细语,共鸣靠前,尾音绵长\n- 活泼少女:音色清脆明亮,高音区轻快,共鸣靠前,咬字活泼\n- 成熟御姐:音色低沉偏沙,慵懒从容,胸腔共鸣,语速偏慢\n- 沧桑故事:音色沙哑粗粝,颗粒感强,低沉缓慢,气息长\n\n**写法要点:音色是唯一重点** —— 多写音色质感(低沉/沙哑/明亮/气声/共鸣位置),少写情绪;情绪保持中性平稳。\n\n**用法:** 生成预览满意 → 保存 wav → 放入 media/input → 06 工作流 LoadAudio 选作参考音色;克隆时用情绪参数控制情绪"],"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":6,"type":"FallingTSContinue","pos":[920,200],"size":[230,90],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"输入","name":"any","type":"*","link":3}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"输出","name":"any","type":"*","links":[4]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"FallingTSContinue","proceedState":"rerun"},"widgets_values":[null]},{"id":7,"type":"SaveAudioAdvanced","pos":[1220,210],"size":[270,178],"flags":{},"order":6,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"audio","name":"audio","type":"AUDIO","link":4},{"localized_name":"filename_prefix","name":"filename_prefix","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"filename_prefix"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"format","name":"format","type":"COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3","widget":{"name":"format"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"format.quality","name":"format.quality","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"format.quality"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"audioUI","name":"audioUI","type":"AUDIO_UI","widget":{"name":"audioUI"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"audio","name":"audio","type":"AUDIO","links":null}],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["audio","mp3","320k"]}],"links":[[1,1,0,2,0,"QWEN3_MODEL"],[2,2,0,3,0,"AUDIO"],[3,3,0,6,0,"AUDIO"],[4,6,0,7,0,"AUDIO"]],"groups":[],"config":{},"extra":{"ds":{"scale":0.7999999999999995,"offset":[-95.68576388888773,248.77604166666657]},"frontendVersion":"1.38.11","workflowRendererVersion":"LG"},"version":0.4}